<description id="description">
<?brief-description-of-drawings description="Brief Description of Drawings" end="lead"?>
<description-of-drawings>
<p id="p-0001" num="0001"><figref idref="DRAWINGS">FIG. 1</figref> is a perspective view showing a front side of a food product in accordance with this invention.</p>
<p id="p-0002" num="0002"><figref idref="DRAWINGS">FIG. 2</figref> is a perspective view showing a back side of the food product.</p>
<p id="p-0003" num="0003"><figref idref="DRAWINGS">FIG. 3</figref> is a front view of the food product showing the front side thereof.</p>
<p id="p-0004" num="0004"><figref idref="DRAWINGS">FIG. 4</figref> is a back view of the food product showing the back side thereof.</p>
<p id="p-0005" num="0005"><figref idref="DRAWINGS">FIG. 5</figref> is a lower edge view of the food product shown <figref idref="DRAWINGS">FIG. 3</figref>, wherein an upper edge view of the food product shown in <figref idref="DRAWINGS">FIG. 3</figref> is a mirror image of <figref idref="DRAWINGS">FIG. 5</figref> and therefore not shown; and,</p>
<p id="p-0006" num="0006"><figref idref="DRAWINGS">FIG. 6</figref> is a lower edge view of the food product shown <figref idref="DRAWINGS">FIG. 4</figref>, wherein an upper edge view of the food product shown in <figref idref="DRAWINGS">FIG. 4</figref> is a mirror image of <figref idref="DRAWINGS">FIG. 6</figref> and therefore not shown.</p>
</description-of-drawings>
